  "arrangerNotes": "2/4 time (eighth = 0.5 beat). Theme verified against the LilyPond score on English Wikipedia (the melody, both halves). Simplifications: the F♯ in the cadence (C C F♯ F♯ G) is played as 4 (F), since tongue drums have no chromatic notes; the fortissimo 'surprise' chord at the end of the score is left out (it's a full-orchestra chord, not part of the tune). Range low 5 to high 1. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
  "verified": true
